{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02578","headline":"出塞 · 虞世南","name":"出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上将三略远，元戎九命尊。\n缅怀古人节，思酬明主恩。\n山西多勇气，塞北有游魂。\n扬桴上陇坂，勒骑下平原。\n誓将绝沙漠，悠然去玉门。\n轻齎不遑舍，惊策骛戎轩。\n凛凛边风急，萧萧征马烦。\n雪暗天山道，冰塞交河源。\n雾锋黯无色，霜旗冻不翻。\n耿介倚长劒，日落风尘昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}